  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>osimertinib</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>L01EB04</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>parent and metabolites, formed from the central compartment <small>(PK_3M_9C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Westra N et al. 2025</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>patients with NSCLC in the OSIBOOST cohort</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>osimertinib</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_osimertinib/Osimertinib_Westra2025_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>Ka (/h) b</td><td>0.24</td><td>1/h</td><td><small>kabs</small></td></tr><tr><td>V/F osimertinib (L) b</td><td>966</td><td>L</td><td><small>V/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>V/F AZ5104 (L) b <small>(AZ5104)</small></td><td>181</td><td>L</td><td><small>V1/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>CL/F osimertinib (L/h) b</td><td>19.0</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>CL/F AZ5104 (L/h) b <small>(AZ5104)</small></td><td>46.3</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>GMR AUC0‐144h [90% CI]</td><td>1</td><td>DL 1</td><td><small>AUC ratio</small></td></tr><tr><td>GMR Cmax [90% CI]</td><td>1</td><td>DL 1</td><td><small>Cmax_ratio</small></td></tr></table><h4>About osimertinib</h4><p>Osimertinib is a third-generation EGFR tyrosine kinase inhibitor used to treat non-small-cell lung cancer with a specific mutation. It is approved and authorised in the European Union for non-small-cell lung carcinoma.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q21506464\">Wikidata Q21506464</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Osimertinib\">Osimertinib</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Westra N et al. (2025). Osimertinib Cost Minimization in Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC) Treatment: Hypothesis Generation for a Population Pharmacokinetic Approach for Equivalent Dose Optimization of Osimertinib in Combination with Cobicistat. <i>Journal of clinical pharmacology 65(12):1687–1698</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/jcph.70085\">10.1002/jcph.70085</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40742292\">40742292</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Westra_2025: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
